                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1 The Company, in recognition of the current high mortgage interest rates, has established the Home Owner's Mortgage Allowance Plan as a temporary supplement which will be made available to Employees permanently transferred by the Company on the following basis:",
            "block_bbox": [
                352,
                269,
                909,
                341
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    352.0,
                    269.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    269.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    341.0
                ],
                [
                    352.0,
                    341.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) Eligibility - All of the following conditions must be met for an Employee to be eligible for the Home Owner's Mortgage Allowance:",
            "block_bbox": [
                373,
                345,
                909,
                383
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    373.0,
                    345.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    345.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    383.0
                ],
                [
                    373.0,
                    383.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Employee's Permanent Transfer shall be initiated by the Company under the provisions of Article 13, Paragraphs 2(f) and 5.",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                388,
                908,
                426
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    388.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    388.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    426.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    426.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Employee shall own a home at the original location and must sell such property. The Employee must also purchase a home at the new location. Both such homes must meet the requirements specified in Article 13, Paragraph 5(d).",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                430,
                909,
                502
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    430.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    430.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    502.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    502.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Employees shall be eligible to this Allowance only once.",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                507,
                814,
                527
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    507.0
                ],
                [
                    813.0,
                    507.0
                ],
                [
                    813.0,
                    526.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    526.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) The interest rate on the Employee's mortgage for the new home must be greater than the rate on the mortgage for the former home.",
            "block_bbox": [
                407,
                532,
                908,
                569
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    407.0,
                    532.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    532.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    569.0
                ],
                [
                    407.0,
                    569.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Computation and Payment of Allowance - Employees who meet the eligibility requirements prescribed in Paragraph 1(a) above will be paid an allowance derived by multiplying the mortgage balance on the Employee's former home or the mortgage on the new home, whichever is lower, by the difference between the old and new interest rates for a three (3) year period subject to the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                373,
                575,
                908,
                680
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    373.0,
                    575.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    575.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    680.0
                ],
                [
                    373.0,
                    680.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) In computing the allowance, the mortgage interest rate differential is based on the basic rate for both the old and new mortgage.",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                685,
                907,
                723
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    685.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    685.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    723.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    723.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The Employee shall provide the Company with the necessary documentation from the mortgage lending institutions verifying the old and new mortgage balances.",
            "block_bbox": [
                405,
                728,
                908,
                782
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    405.0,
                    728.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    728.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    782.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    782.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Payment will be made to the Employee in a lump sum. The payment is taxable income and subject to withholding by the Company. No tax loan will be made to Employees on this payment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                786,
